---
title: "Introduction to Horticulture (Fall)"
code: "HRT-100"
category: "horticulture"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Introduces commercial horticulture industry with emphasis on career opportunities. Examines equipment, facilities, and physical arrangements of production, wholesale and retail establishments. Surveys individual areas within horticulture industry. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 2 hours. Total 4 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
